                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8da05d2a-9ded-3320-894a-94c254b4a798",
                        "entry_id": "d7f8794f-ae23-3649-9a48-9a9411b15e62",
                        "glosses": [
                            "philology department (in a university)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d5987f0-4dd9-4fe2-99e8-a183de4cfe41",
                                "sense_id": "8da05d2a-9ded-3320-894a-94c254b4a798",
                                "text": "— В како́й о́бласти выявля́ете себя́? — спроси́л он.\n— Где рабо́таю, что ли? — не по́нял кандида́т.\n— Да.\n— На филфа́ке.\n— Филосо́фия?\n— Не совсе́м... Ну, мо́жно и так сказа́ть.",
                                "translation": "\"What area are you active in?\" he asked.\n\"Where do I work, you mean?\" asked the candidate of science, bewildered.\n\"Yes.\"\n\"In the faculty of philology.\"\n\"Philosophy?\"\n\"Not exactly... But you could say that.\"",
                                "english": "\"What area are you active in?\" he asked.\n\"Where do I work, you mean?\" asked the candidate of science, bewildered.\n\"Yes.\"\n\"In the faculty of philology.\"\n\"Philosophy?\"\n\"Not exactly... But you could say that.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
